WEBVTT

00:09:27.547 --> 00:09:30.647
That would be a world
that does sound beautiful,

00:09:30.671 --> 00:09:34.558
and one where understanding
would be the norm,

00:09:34.582 --> 00:09:37.231
and that is an idea worth spreading.

00:09:37.255 --> 00:09:38.387
Thank you.

00:09:38.411 --> 00:09:39.933
(Applause)